Z||000016||Scott||06-11-2001||12:33 AM||||I don't normally reply to this kind of stuff. But, as a new member, I feel compelled to say this: 86seyellow, GET A LIFE! You haven't even delt w/ the gentleman, and you're on his case. <BR>Dave's a great guy.  I recently bought some things from him, and by the time I left he GAVE me a few other parts I needed. A truely nice and honorable man.  And, his prices are very reasonable.  Well, I'll get of the soapbox now.<BR>Scott<BR>-a new member trying to represent... ||||reg||1
