Z||000018||RobertVol||06-11-2001||01:52 AM||||Has anybody noticed the IDIOT has not responded??!!?!<P>Uhh <P>Lets see thats 1 for the guy who posted and......<P><BR>alot for Fiero DAVE and here is another...<P>Fierodave is great. HE has been nothing but open with me on deals when he gets them and helped me out on many occasions! AND YES! HE sends parts without you even paying first! He is a trusting guy who may make a few dollars but keeps us fiero guys in the parts when we need them. <P>I put FIERODAVE up there with My favorite fiero vendors:<P>Fierostore<BR>Doug Kinney<BR>FIERODAVE<BR>Rodney Dickman<BR>Ed Parks<P>All the above guys are great to deal with and I am glad to have them around!!!<P>Thank God we have people like that. Were would be without the Fiero vendors??<P>Think about it. and then someone comes along like this and just throws out a crazy claim. <P>I tell you one thing, this kinda stuff could cause some of our vendors to say "SCREW IT" <BR>and get out of the Fiero support business and then were would we be!?!? <P>Something to think about. <P>OK .....I VENTED <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000019||JAMIE||06-11-2001||07:45 AM||||Dave - I really cannot see how anyone could say anything but good things about you - it is so sad to see such a good person get flamed - I find it almost unbelievable that this has happened to you.<P>To anyone thinking about dealing with Dave - do not hesitate to do so.He is honest and reliable. The parts he sends are always exactly as described, fairly priced, and delivered quickly. I have purchased many parts from many vendors over the years - Dave is one of a handful of key vendors in the Fiero business - you simply will not find a better guy to deal with.Dave has given me a lot of help and advice over the last several years - far beyond the value of the parts I have purchased from him. <P>Dave - don't lose any sleep over this - your impeccable reputation is earned through years of hard work - an unfair comment does not diminish this fact.<P>JAMIE <P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000020||FieroHarry||06-11-2001||07:56 AM||||I feel anyone who is in the buss. for Fiero's parts, cars, etc etc is:<P>A: Not out to make a fortune, first of all think about it.<BR>To make lots of money you need lots of demand and lord knows there are not enough of us out there to make a decent demand for most suppliers. Hence no one is yet making repo interior.<P>B: Care's about the fiero community, honestly I know there are some out there that couldnt give a damn. They sell you the part/parts/cars and forgot you ever lived.<BR>How many dealers in your town would sell you a used car then come to your door in the next state to get the car plus bring it back when its repaired? NOT A DAMN ONE!<BR>Get real here, Dave gives a poop about us and is willing to bend over backwards to help.<P>If it wasnt for people like Dave and many others I couldnt even begin to name them all,<BR>Cliff included, we wouldnt be here discussing the lack of merits and inteligent forthought in your statement!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>My ten cents!<P>------------------<BR><B>Harry Waggoner</B><BR>1985 GT 264K+ <I>FOCOSEVA,FOCOA</I><BR><B>"Im not driving to fast, Im flying to low!"</B><p>[This message has been edited by FieroHarry (edited 06-11-2001).]||||reg||1
