Z||000025||fierodave||06-12-2001||09:04 PM||||<BR>Thank you all for your support.<BR>It feels good to know there are some that care enough to back you up when stupid rude & slanderous comments have been put against you!<BR>I don't have much...... But I have a good name and reputation with most of the fiero community and won't let one person  hurt my name!<P>I don't think I will be  posting parts for sale here now,  There has been to many people complaining on my prices anyway!<P>Just wonder if the chosen few that seem to always complain know  what it took to get all the parts back from Ca. and what I put up in money  and gave up  so I could supply the parts!!!!!!  Yes  I make money on the parts lol  If I wasn't going to, I wouldn't have purchased all the stuff out there.   Not many of you know of the problems I have had since getting that stuff,  a partner out there that had a heart attack and could no longer help with packing the stuff for sale so I had to go get it all  (some still out there yet)  And haul it back to Wi. in U-haul trucks!  I had to Go to Ca three times since last November!<BR>Enough rambles  <BR>Thanks to all the backed me up <BR>on this post.<BR>My customers know how to get hold of me.<BR>Thanks for the space<BR>FD<BR>||||reg||2
Z||000026||DXR_DAD||06-12-2001||09:41 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005051.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005051.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007770.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007770.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006569.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006569.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005649.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005649.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004576.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004576.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/000136.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/000136.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/000284.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/000284.html</A> <P>This will speak fo itself,  and it's just the tip. There are many, many more.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>THANKS Dave, I know how to find ya.<P>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
Z||000027||DRH||06-13-2001||09:43 AM||||Dave, <P>Please don't quit posting in the mall because of one, or even a few, idiots. I'm sure these post have been beneficial to MANY people in the past.<P>Most of the stuff I've seen you selling seemed to have a reasonable price, higher than some, lower than others. A lot of people don't seem to understand the economics of running a business vs. getting rid of stuff you don't really need. In the first case you have to turn a profit, in the second it's ALL profit. <P>If someone doesn't want to pay what you're asking, they are always free to get it somewhere else. On the other hand, the same price might seem like a bargain to someone who's searched everywhere for a particular part. <P><BR>David.<P>||||reg||1
